{"id": "TASK-001", "artifacts_context": "Generate a synthetic but realistic project artifact bundle.\n\nInputs:\n- Sector: state government licensing\n- Architecture: REST + PostgreSQL + tenant-scoped case workflow\n- Artifact type: API documentation\n- Complexity level: medium\n- Required BOLA patterns: cross-tenant read, write-by-foreign-id, linked-resource ownership bypass\n\nOutput format (strict markdown):\n1. Project context (4-8 bullets)\n2. Authorization model (roles, tenants, ownership rules)\n3. API/spec/log content:\n   - If artifact_type is API doc: concrete endpoints and request/response examples.\n   - If artifact_type is schema: tables/objects/relationships and key fields.\n   - If artifact_type is network log: realistic request traces with IDs/tokens placeholders.\n4. Insert exactly 3 intentional high-risk BOLA opportunities.\n5. Include a short \"Ground truth risk list\" section mapping each risk to endpoint/object.\n\nConstraints:\n- Every path/object in risk list must appear verbatim in the artifact content.\n- Include at least one read-path and one write-path BOLA risk.\n- Avoid generic filler text; keep it actionable for auditors.\n\n\nDocumented endpoints:\n- GET /api/v1/records/{recordId}\n- PATCH /api/v1/records/{recordId}", "expected_response": "## Findings\n- GET /api/v1/records/{recordId}: ownership check may be missing; verify with Token A and Token B.\n- PATCH /api/v1/records/{recordId}: write authorization may be missing; verify with Token A and Token B.\n\n## Verification Runbook\n1. Call GET /api/v1/records/{recordId} with Token A.\n2. Call GET /api/v1/records/{recordId} with Token B.\n3. Repeat for PATCH /api/v1/records/{recordId}.\n\n## Grounding Self-check\n- /api/v1/records/{recordId}\n\n## Uncertainty\n- Ownership policy details are not fully documented.", "analysis_explanation": "OFFLINE-GATE: reviewer call skipped; deterministic gates only."}
